        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eisikong'a Mika ilarikok le Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atejo nanu: entoning intae ilukuny e Yakobo o larikok le nkaji e Israel! Aimeishiaakino intae niyiolouu esipata, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "intae ilooiba esupatisho ninyorrinyorro entorroni, intae ilooyieng iltung'ana laainei, nirishushu nkiri enye too loik lenye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "intae ilooinos nkiri oo ltung'ana laainei, nenang'aa ilonito lenye aaidie ninche, nigiligili iloik lenye aaitaa ng'iligilat, nigiligil anaa iloik oopiki emoti, netiu anaa nkiri naatii emoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninche aaishiraki Olaitoriani, kake mewaliki ninye ninche; eisudoo ninye enkomom enye te ninche teina rishata, enkaraki naitaa ninche nkiaasin enye torrok.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nji ejo Olaitoriani tialo lelo oibonok ooitapong'oo iltung'ana laainei. Lelo ooishir aajo, “Eseriani” ina kata eeta ninche endaa nainos, neitayu olarrabal te ilo lemeeta endaa naisho meinosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina, kemutu te ntae nimintokiki aata nduaat nemisimisu te ntae nimintokiki aata nkitumusumusot. Kedoyio enkolong too loibonok, neman emisimisi ninche; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore lelo aduaak netusulaki, neitukurruni lelo aitumusumusok; kepuo pooki aaiken nkutukie enye, amu metii ewalata naing'uaa Enkai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore nanu, aaiputa engolon, o enkiyang'et o Laitoriani, te sipata o te nkidimata, pee aibalakinye Yakobo enkitapong'oto enye, naibalekinye Israel eng'oki enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entoning ena, intae ilarikok le nkaji e Israel, intae ooibooyo esipata, nimbelekenyenye enkiguana nasipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilo oshet Sion to sarge neshet Yerusalem te ntorroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edung ilarikok lenye enkiguana te ropare, neiteng'enisho ilapolosak lenye te laakinoto, neibonisho iloibonok lenye too ropiyiani; eji neigarakino ake sii Olaitoriani ejo, “Aimetii Olaitoriani atua iyiook? Meetae entorroni nalotu shumata iyiook.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MIC 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.26.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 26.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore naa te nkaraki iyie kepuoi aatur Sion anaa enkurma; keaku Yerusalem osototi le nkidaata; neaku ilo doinyo le nkaji entim.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
